Cell["\<\
Check of expressions were grade powers are multiplied is a bit tricky and \
inconvenient. The better way is under search that that below\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.673770213170585*^9, 3.673770271212688*^9}, {
  3.673770498050648*^9, 3.673770512428942*^9}, {3.67377085466058*^9, 
