Cell["\<\
In general formula we restrict a2  to vectors by changing iterator limit for \
vector to {r,2,gaVectorSpaceDimension[testAlgebra]+1} (first index reserved \
for the scalar).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.673770213170585*^9, 3.673770271212688*^9}, {
